post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
gw2api installed.

1) Edit /etc/gw2api/gw2api.conf and set GW2API_ADMIN_TOKEN to a strong secret.
2) Enable and start the service:

   systemctl daemon-reload
   systemctl enable --now gw2api.service

The API listens on http://127.0.0.1:8083/v1 (OpenAI-compatible);
the admin dashboard uses the same port with your admin token.
Database is stored in /var/lib/gw2api/gw2api.db.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    post_install
}
